# STR candidate coordinates for the illumina-bam-hg38 slice (HipSTR-format: chrom start end period ref_copies NAME motif).
#
# Input to harness/build_panel.py, which measures each against the BAM and decides
# which make the panel (datasets/illumina-bam-hg38/loci.bed). Candidates that fail the depth floor
# are excluded there, with the reason. Lives at dataset level ON PURPOSE: the panel is
# a property of the slice, not of any one tool, so cleaning a tool asset must never
# silently change it.
#
